@startuml
title FE-04 Clarification, Quote Handoff and Full Payment
actor Member
actor Staff
actor Manager
participant DesignRequestController
participant HumanReviewService
participant CustomOrderService
participant QuoteService
participant PaymentGatewayCheckoutPort
Member -> DesignRequestController : submit clarification revision
DesignRequestController -> HumanReviewService : validate ownership and version
HumanReviewService --> Member : NEED_REVIEW after revision
Staff -> HumanReviewService : accept with explanation
HumanReviewService -> CustomOrderService : hand off accepted snapshot
CustomOrderService -> QuoteService : prepare quote
Manager -> QuoteService : approve quote
Member -> CustomOrderService : open My Custom Orders
Member -> PaymentGatewayCheckoutPort : pay full quoted amount
PaymentGatewayCheckoutPort --> CustomOrderService : verified full payment
CustomOrderService --> Member : PAID order state
note over Member,Manager
No deposit, cart line, split payment or indefinite unpaid hold.
end note
@enduml
